{%- comment -%}
  Free shipping threshold, per market. Single source of truth.

  Previously there was one global number — `settings.free_shipping_threshold`,
  hardcoded to 75 — applied to all five enabled markets, plus a second,
  completely separate hardcoding of the literal string "free shipping over $75"
  in the announcement bar. A UK customer at £55 was told "£20 away from free
  shipping" when they already qualified, and was shown a dollar sign either way.
  A line that discourages checkout at the moment of decision.

  Keyed on `localization.country.iso_code` rather than on currency, because the
  International market can present in USD. Keying on currency would show a US
  visitor's $75 threshold to a Netherlands customer who has no free rate at all.
  Country is the thing the shipping rate is actually attached to.

  Thresholds are the rates confirmed configured in Shopify Shipping. Anything
  not listed renders NOTHING rather than guessing a number — CA, NZ and
  International have no confirmed free rate, and cart.js's own comment already
  conceded this line "is display-only, the real rate lives in Shopify Shipping".
  Promising a threshold that does not exist is worse than staying quiet.

  When you add a market, add it here and nowhere else. Both the cart drawer
  progress line and the announcement bar read from this one snippet.

  Usage:
    {% render 'free-shipping', mode: 'json' %}   → {"threshold":7500,"symbol":"$"}
    {% render 'free-shipping', mode: 'text' %}   → free shipping over $75

  Both render empty/zero for a market with no confirmed rate.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fs_amount = 0
  assign fs_symbol = ''

  case localization.country.iso_code
    when 'AU'
      assign fs_amount = 75
      assign fs_symbol = '$'
    when 'US'
      assign fs_amount = 75
      assign fs_symbol = '$'
    when 'GB'
      assign fs_amount = 50
      assign fs_symbol = '£'
  endcase

  assign fs_cents = fs_amount | times: 100
-%}

{%- if mode == 'json' -%}
{"threshold":{{ fs_cents }},"symbol":{{ fs_symbol | json }}}
{%- elsif mode == 'text' -%}
{%- if fs_amount > 0 -%}free shipping over {{ fs_symbol }}{{ fs_amount }}{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
